  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Village Resources Database and Status of Educ in Assam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is to 1) develop integrated database for all inhabited revenue villages in Assam with GIS Interface; and to 2) conduct survey of education attainments of people in the riverine areas (Chars) of River Brahmaputra.</narrative>
  </description>
